msgid "Triton-Ascend 调试指南"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend Debug Guide"

msgid "1 引言"
msgstr "1 Introduction"

msgid "本文档为 **Triton-Ascend 调试指南**，面向参与 Triton 与昇腾（Ascend）NPU 适配开发的工程师，系统性地介绍在 Triton-Ascend 编译与运行过程中常用的调试方法与工具。"
msgstr "This document is the **Triton-Ascend Debugging Guide**, intended for engineers involved in the adaptation and development of Triton with Ascend NPUs. It systematically introduces common debugging methods and tools used during the compilation and execution of Triton-Ascend."

msgid "全文内容概览如下："
msgstr "The full content overview is as follows:"

msgid "章节"
msgstr "Chapter"

msgid "主要内容"
msgstr "Main Content"

msgid "**1. 概述**"
msgstr "**1. Overview**"

msgid "说明调试的核心目标（聚焦 `ttir.mlir` → `ttadapter.mlir` 转换），并对常见问题进行分类指引。"
msgstr "Explains the core objective of debugging (focusing on the `ttir.mlir` → `ttadapter.mlir` conversion) and provides categorized guidance for common issues."

msgid "**2. 编译流程概览**"
msgstr "**2. Compilation Process Overview**"

msgid "介绍 Triton-Ascend 端到端编译链的关键阶段，为后续调试提供上下文基础。"
msgstr "Introduce the key stages of the Triton-Ascend end-to-end compilation chain, providing contextual foundation for subsequent debugging."

msgid "**3. 临时文件指引**"
msgstr "**3. Temporary File Guide**"

msgid "详解编译过程中生成的中间文件（如 `.mlir`、`.ll`、`.o` 等）的存储位置与用途，便于人工检查。"
msgstr "Detailed explanation of the storage location and purpose of intermediate files generated during compilation (such as `.mlir`, `.ll`, `.o`, etc.) to facilitate manual inspection."

msgid "**4. 解释器模式**"
msgstr "**4. Interpreter Pattern**"

msgid "介绍如何通过 `TRITON_INTERPRET=1` 在 CPU 上运行 kernel，作为 NPU 计算结果的精度基准。"
msgstr "Introduces how to run the kernel on CPU using `TRITON_INTERPRET=1` as a precision baseline for NPU computation results."

msgid "**5. 调试方法**"
msgstr "**5. Debugging Methods**"

msgid "提供多种实用调试手段：<br>• 静态/运行时打印<br>• 编译错误调试方法<br>"
msgstr "Provides multiple practical debugging methods:<br>• Static/runtime printing<br>• Compilation error debugging methods"

msgid "**附录 A**"
msgstr "**Appendix A**"

msgid "常用环境变量速查表，提升调试效率。"
msgstr "Common Environment Variable Quick Reference Table to Improve Debugging Efficiency."

msgid "建议开发者结合具体问题，按需查阅对应章节，以高效定位并解决 Triton-Ascend 集成中的各类异常。"
msgstr "Developers are advised to refer to the corresponding sections as needed based on specific issues, in order to efficiently locate and resolve various anomalies in the Triton-Ascend integration."

msgid "1.1 Triton-Ascend 常见问题分类与调试指引"
msgstr "1.1 Triton-Ascend Common Issue Classification and Debugging Guide"

msgid "在开发过程中，问题通常可归纳为以下几类。下表提供了快速的问题类型辨识与首选调试方法指引。"
msgstr "During development, problems can generally be categorized into the following types. The table below provides a quick guide for identifying problem types and preferred debugging methods."

msgid "问题类型"
msgstr "Problem Type"

msgid "典型表现/描述"
msgstr "Typical Manifestation/Description"

msgid "推荐的首要调试方法"
msgstr "Recommended primary debugging method"

msgid "**精度问题**"
msgstr "**Precision Issues**"

msgid "NPU运行结果与标杆参考结果（如PyTorch或Triton CPU解释器）存在差异。"
msgstr "The NPU execution results differ from the benchmark reference results (such as PyTorch or Triton CPU interpreter)."

msgid "4. 解释器模式 <br> 5.1 打印调试方法"
msgstr "4. Interpreter Pattern <br> 5.1 Print Debugging Method"

msgid "**编译错误 (MLIRCompileError)**"
msgstr "**Compilation Error (MLIRCompileError)**"

msgid "在编译转换阶段失败，通常在Python端抛出 `MLIRCompileError`。"
msgstr "Failure during the compilation and conversion stage, typically raises `MLIRCompileError` on the Python side."

msgid "5.2 编译错误调试方法"
msgstr "5.2 Compilation Error Debugging Methods"

msgid "2 Triton-Ascend 编译流程概览"
msgstr "2 Overview of Triton-Ascend Compilation Process"

msgid "理解完整的编译链是进行有效调试的基础。Triton-Ascend 的编译过程遵循以下主要阶段："
msgstr "Understanding the complete compilation chain is the foundation for effective debugging. The compilation process of Triton-Ascend follows the following main stages:"

