msgid "trace.json 支持以下两种可视化呈现方式："
msgstr "trace.json supports the following two visualization presentation methods:"

msgid "Chrome浏览器 在Chrome浏览器中输入 ```chrome://tracing``` 地址，并将通过msprof op simulator 生成指令流水图文件（trace.json）拖到空白处打开，键盘上输入快捷键（W：放大；S：缩小；A：左移；D：右移）可进行查看。 **图2** Chrome浏览器时间线界面 ![alt text](../figures/trace_json_with_chrome.png)"
msgstr "Chrome browser Enter ```chrome://tracing``` in the Chrome browser address bar, drag the instruction pipeline diagram file (trace.json) generated by msprof op simulator into the blank area to open it, and use keyboard shortcuts (W: zoom in; S: zoom out; A: move left; D: move right) to view. **Figure 2** Chrome browser timeline interface ![alt text](../figures/trace_json_with_chrome.png)"

msgid "[MindStudio Insight](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/mindstudio/82RC1/GUI_baseddevelopmenttool/msascendinsightug/Insight_userguide_0005.html)可视化呈现 MindStudio Insight工具以时序图方式为用户提供指令在昇腾AI处理器上的运行情况，用户可通过分析时序图中的指令详情、指令执行时间、指令关联代码的调用栈及指令/流水间同步连线等信息，识别微观指令的时序优化点。 **图3** MindStudio Insight时间线界面 ![alt text](../figures/trace_json_with_insight.png)"
msgstr "[MindStudio Insight](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/mindstudio/82RC1/GUI_baseddevelopmenttool/msascendinsightug/Insight_userguide_0005.html) visually presents the operation of instructions on the Ascend AI processor in a timeline format using the MindStudio Insight tool. Users can analyze details such as instruction details, instruction execution time, the call stack of instruction-related code, and synchronization connections between instructions/pipelines in the timeline to identify optimization points for micro-instruction timing. **Figure 3** MindStudio Insight Timeline Interface ![alt text](../figures/trace_json_with_insight.png)"

msgid "visualize_data.bin支持在MindStudio Insight可视化呈现："
msgstr "visualize_data.bin supports visualization in MindStudio Insight."

msgid "除了与trace.json一样可以采集到性能数据之外，visualize_data.bin还提供了与源代码（如：03-layer-norm.py）对应的指令关联看板。 **图4** MindStudio Insight-visualize_data.bin指令关联"
msgstr "In addition to collecting performance data like trace.json, visualize_data.bin also provides an instruction correlation dashboard corresponding to the source code (e.g., 03-layer-norm.py). **Figure 4** MindStudio Insight-visualize_data.bin instruction correlation"

msgid "注：以下采集项的结果数据含义可参考《MindStudio Insight 工具》的[算子调优](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/mindstudio/82RC1/GUI_baseddevelopmenttool/msascendinsightug/Insight_userguide_0068.html)章节。 ![alt text](../figures/visualize_data_with_insight.png)"
msgstr "Note: For the meaning of the result data of the following collection items, refer to the [Operator Tuning](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/mindstudio/82RC1/GUI_baseddevelopmenttool/msascendinsightug/Insight_userguide_0068.html) section of the *MindStudio Insight Tool*. ![alt text](../figures/visualize_data_with_insight.png)"

msgid "仿真流水图采集Triton算子Debug版本"
msgstr "Simulation pipeline trace collection for Triton operator debug version"

msgid "仿真流水图（trace.json / visualize_data.bin）默认只包含指令地址与指令名。若希望在MindStudio Insight中使用指令关联看板、查看指令对应的Triton/Python源码行与调用栈（即[查找瓶颈](#查找瓶颈)中的方法四），需要将算子编译为带debug_line调试信息的版本。未开启时，msprof op simulator会输出如下提示，且代码关联文件为空："
msgstr "The simulation trace (trace.json / visualize_data.bin) by default only contains instruction addresses and instruction names. To use the instruction correlation panel in MindStudio Insight and view the Triton/Python source lines and call stacks corresponding to instructions (i.e., Method 4 in [Finding Bottlenecks](#finding-bottlenecks)), the operator needs to be compiled into a version with debug_line information. When not enabled, msprof op simulator will output the following prompt, and the code correlation file will be empty:"

msgid "Triton算子无需手动添加`-g`，triton-ascend后端通过环境变量`TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO`控制是否在`bishengir-compile`命令中追加`--enable-debug-info=true`。注意triton-ascend默认值为`true`（即默认**关闭**行号信息，与社区Triton默认开启相反），需显式置为`False`："
msgstr "Triton operators do not require manually adding `-g`. The triton-ascend backend controls whether to append `--enable-debug-info=true` to the `bishengir-compile` command via the environment variable `TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO`. Note that the default value of triton-ascend is `true` (i.e., line number information is **disabled** by default, contrary to the community Triton where it is enabled by default), and it needs to be explicitly set to `False`:"

msgid "验证是否生效：日志中`[DEBUG] cmd_list:`一行应包含`--enable-debug-info=true`，且`Kernel missed debug_line information`告警消失。随后将`visualize_data.bin`导入MindStudio Insight，即可在指令时序图中查看每条指令关联的源码行与调用栈。"
msgstr "Verify whether it has taken effect: The `[DEBUG] cmd_list:` line in the log should contain `--enable-debug-info=true`, and the `Kernel missed debug_line information` warning should disappear. Then import `visualize_data.bin` into MindStudio Insight to view the source code line and call stack associated with each instruction in the instruction timing diagram."

msgid "分析性能数据"
msgstr "Analyze performance data"

msgid "理论参数"
msgstr "Theoretical Parameters"

msgid "理论性能为算子实际性能的理想目标。不同的硬件平台的硬件规格各异，理论性能可以帮助我们了解硬件的潜能，从而设定性能优化的目标。"
msgstr "Theoretical performance represents the ideal target for the actual performance of an operator. Different hardware platforms have varying hardware specifications, and theoretical performance can help us understand the potential of the hardware, thereby setting performance optimization goals."

msgid "搬运相关流水（MTE1/MTE2/MTE3等）的理论耗时 = 搬运数据量（单位：Byte）/ 理论带宽。例如：某款AI处理器的GM峰值带宽约为1.8TB/s，想要进行一次float数据类型、4096 * 4096大小的矩阵搬运，搬运的理论耗时是`sizeof(float) * 4096 * 4096 / 1.8 TB/s = 37.28 us`（按照1 TB = 10<sup>12</sup> Byte来计算）。"
msgstr "The theoretical time for transferring related streams (MTE1/MTE2/MTE3, etc.) = data transfer volume (unit: Byte) / theoretical bandwidth. For example: the GM peak bandwidth of a certain AI processor is approximately 1.8 TB/s. To transfer a matrix of float data type with a size of 4096 * 4096, the theoretical transfer time is `sizeof(float) * 4096 * 4096 / 1.8 TB/s = 37.28 us` (calculated with 1 TB = 10<sup>12</sup> Byte)."

msgid "说明:"
msgstr "Description:"

msgid "搬运指令同时存在时，会存在共享带宽的情况，并不能每条都以接近理论带宽的速率搬运数据。比如，当MTE2/MTE3同时进行GM读写时，搬运流水线的耗时应该是（MTE2搬运量 + MTE3搬运量）/ GM带宽。"
msgstr "When multiple transfer instructions exist simultaneously, they share bandwidth, and not each instruction can transfer data at a rate close to the theoretical bandwidth. For example, when MTE2/MTE3 perform GM read and write at the same time, the time consumed by the transfer pipeline should be (MTE2 transfer amount + MTE3 transfer amount) / GM bandwidth."

msgid "搬运不同大小的数据块时，对带宽的利用率（有效带宽/理论带宽）不一样。针对每次搬运数据量较小的情况，实测性能达不到理论带宽。"
msgstr "When transferring data blocks of different sizes, the bandwidth utilization (effective bandwidth / theoretical bandwidth) varies. For cases where the amount of data transferred each time is small, the measured performance cannot reach the theoretical bandwidth."

msgid "计算相关流水（Cube/Vector/Scalar等）的理论耗时 = 计算数据量（单位：Element） / 理论算力。例如：某款AI处理器对float数据类型的Vector理论峰值算力为11.06 TOPS，想要进行一次32K float类型的Element单指令计算，计算的理论耗时是32K / 11.06TOPS = 0.003us （按照1K =1000来计算）。"
msgstr "The theoretical time consumption for computation-related pipelines (Cube/Vector/Scalar, etc.) = computation data volume (unit: Element) / theoretical computing power. For example: a certain AI processor has a theoretical peak computing power of 11.06 TOPS for Vector operations on float data types. To perform a single instruction computation on 32K float-type Elements, the theoretical time consumption is 32K / 11.06 TOPS = 0.003us (calculated with 1K = 1000)."

msgid "查找瓶颈"
msgstr "Find the bottleneck"

msgid "获取性能数据后，和理论数值差异较大的地方、耗时较长的流程被认为是“瓶颈点”。下文将介绍如何通过性能数据找到瓶颈点和对应的优化方向。"
msgstr "After obtaining performance data, areas with significant deviations from theoretical values and processes with long execution times are considered \"bottlenecks.\" The following section will introduce how to identify bottlenecks through performance data and the corresponding optimization directions."

msgid "方法一：通过上板Profiling分析流水情况 查看上板Profiling解析后的op_summary_\\*.csv文件分析流水情况。注：“\\*”表示时间戳。 ![analyse_data_op_summary](../figures/performance_analysis_analyse_data_op_summary.png)"
msgstr "Method 1: Analyze pipeline status by board-level Profiling. View the op_summary_*.csv file after board-level Profiling parsing to analyze the pipeline status. Note: \"*\" indicates a timestamp. ![analyse_data_op_summary](../figures/performance_analysis_analyse_data_op_summary.png)"

msgid "analyse_data_op_summary"
msgstr "analyse_data_op_summary"

msgid "每条流水线的利用率理想情况下应为100%，没有达到100%的流水就可能有提升空间。上图示例中为某款AI处理器上获取的数据，可以看到Vector算子_layer_norm_fwd_fused的第一个场景中，Vector流水的利用率aiv_vec_ratio小于10%，判断未充分发挥算力；Scalar流水的利用率aiv_scalar_ratio已经在60%左右，判断Scalar是最长的流水。   当Scalar是最长的流水时：需要分析算子源码中是否对标量值进行复杂的运算，昇腾的SIMD微架构更适合多数据并行计算；另一种可能性是，由于一部分指令在硬件上不支持特定的数据类型，Triton软件栈将向量计算退化为标量计算。需要结合流水和标量优化手段进行优化，可参考方法三、查看仿真流水图，以及方法四、查看代码热点的情况进一步分析。   对于更一般的情况，例如MTE2搬运和实际的场景：三个输入矩阵的shape分别为(128,128)、(128,1)、(128,1)，数据类型为float16。当前算法为Two-pass方法，因此有三次X的搬入，以及W、B的各一次搬入，由此可以计算出总共需要搬运的数据量，继而通过[理论参数](#理论参数)中介绍的搬运流水理论耗时计算方法计算出理论值为 `sizeof(float16) * (128 * 128 * 3 + 128 + 128) / 1.8 TB/s ≈ 0.1991 us`（按照1 TB = $10^{12}$ Byte来计算），与实际性能数据aiv_mte2_time存在比较大的差距。经分析，输入数据的总大小小于UB的空间（A2型号为192KB）。因此MTE2时间过长可能是Tiling计算得到的基本块太小，导致发射冗余的搬运指令。需要结合流水优化和Tiling优化手段进行优化。可参考方法三，查看仿真流水图，进一步分析各条流水的情况。"
msgstr "Ideally, the utilization rate of each pipeline should be 100%. Any pipeline that does not reach 100% may have room for improvement. The example in the figure above shows data obtained from a certain AI processor. It can be seen that in the first scenario of the Vector operator `_layer_norm_fwd_fused`, the utilization rate of the Vector pipeline `aiv_vec_ratio` is less than 10%, indicating that the computing power is not fully utilized; the utilization rate of the Scalar pipeline `aiv_scalar_ratio` is already around 60%, indicating that Scalar is the longest pipeline. When Scalar is the longest pipeline: it is necessary to analyze whether the operator source code involves complex operations on scalar values. The Ascend SIMD microarchitecture is more suitable for multi-data parallel computing. Another possibility is that due to some instructions not supporting specific data types in hardware, the Triton software stack degrades vector computations to scalar computations. Optimization should be combined with pipeline and scalar optimization methods. Refer to Method 3, viewing the simulation pipeline diagram, and Method 4, examining code hotspots for further analysis. For more general cases, such as MTE2 data movement and actual scenarios: the shapes of the three input matrices are (128,128), (128,1), and (128,1) respectively, with a data type of float16. The current algorithm is the Two-pass method, so there are three loads of X, and one load each of W and B. From this, the total amount of data to be moved can be calculated. Then, using the theoretical time calculation method for the movement pipeline introduced in [Theoretical Parameters](#theoretical parameters), the theoretical value is computed as `sizeof(float16) * (128 * 128 * 3 + 128 + 128) / 1.8 TB/s ≈ 0.1991 us` (calculated with 1 TB = $10^{12}$ Byte), which shows a significant gap compared to the actual performance data `aiv_mte2_time`. Analysis reveals that the total size of the input data is smaller than the UB space (192KB for the A2 model). Therefore, the excessive MTE2 time may be due to the basic blocks obtained from Tiling computation being too small, resulting in redundant movement instructions. Optimization should be combined with pipeline optimization and Tiling optimization methods. Refer to Method 3, viewing the simulation pipeline diagram, to further analyze the status of each pipeline."

msgid "方法二：通过上板Profiling分析Tiling情况 先前示例中使用的AI处理器，可以通过硬件平台查看到有48个Vector核，_layer_norm_fwd_fused算子是一个纯Vector算子，但是有些场景下发了过多的Block（Block Dim > 48），造成Host调度开销过大。那么下一步的主要优化方向为Tiling优化。"
msgstr "Method 2: Analyzing Tiling Conditions via On-Board Profiling. The AI processor used in the previous example can be observed through the hardware platform to have 48 Vector cores. The `_layer_norm_fwd_fused` operator is a pure Vector operator, but in some scenarios, too many Blocks are dispatched (Block Dim > 48), resulting in excessive Host scheduling overhead. Therefore, the next main optimization direction is Tiling optimization."

msgid "方法三：通过仿真流水图分析流水情况 ![analyse_data_waveform](../figures/performance_analysis_analyse_data_waveform.png)   上图示例中为某款AI处理器仿真器上获取的数据，可以看到Vector核的SCALAR以及FLOWCTRL的指令饱和，可以结合算子逻辑分析，是否存在过多标量计算以及不支持的向量化操作。下一步的主要优化方向为标量计算优化。另一方面，可以看到Vector核的相关流水（veccore0的MTE2、VECTOR等）有规律性的断流现象，即大量无操作的空白段。可以结合算子逻辑分析，是否存在基本块切分过小等因素导致断流。主要优化方向为流水优化，其次结合Tiling优化和内存优化等手段进一步提升Vector流水利用率。"
msgstr "Method 3: Analyzing pipeline behavior through simulation pipeline diagram ![analyse_data_waveform](../figures/performance_analysis_analyse_data_waveform.png) The example above shows data obtained from a certain AI processor simulator. It can be observed that the SCALAR and FLOWCTRL instructions of the Vector core are saturated. Combined with operator logic analysis, it is necessary to determine whether there are excessive scalar computations and unsupported vectorized operations. The next major optimization direction is scalar computation optimization. On the other hand, it can be seen that the relevant pipelines of the Vector core (such as MTE2 and VECTOR of veccore0) exhibit periodic pipeline stalls, i.e., large blank segments with no operations. Combined with operator logic analysis, it is necessary to determine whether factors such as overly small basic block splitting cause the stalls. The main optimization direction is pipeline optimization, followed by Tiling optimization and memory optimization to further improve Vector pipeline utilization."

msgid "analyse_data_waveform"
msgstr "analyse_data_waveform"

msgid "方法四：通过代码热点分析情况 ![analyse_data_code_mapping](../figures/performance_analysis_analyse_data_code_mapping.png)   上图示例中为某款AI处理器仿真器上获取的数据，可以看到左侧load接口对应到右侧的一组汇编指令中（已筛选仅显示代码行相关指令，并按运行拍数降序排序），标量指令占比高，不符合load作为访存接口应该MTE占比高的情况。因此主要优化方向为标量计算。"
msgstr "Method 4: Analyzing the Situation Through Code Hotspots ![analyse_data_code_mapping](../figures/performance_analysis_analyse_data_code_mapping.png) In the example above, data obtained from an AI processor simulator shows that the load interface on the left corresponds to a set of assembly instructions on the right (filtered to display only code-line-related instructions, sorted in descending order by execution cycles). The proportion of scalar instructions is high, which does not align with the expected scenario where load, as a memory access interface, should have a high proportion of MTE. Therefore, the main optimization direction is scalar computation."

msgid "analyse_data_code_mapping"
msgstr "analyse_data_code_mapping"

msgid "示例：i64/i32 的compare在npu上无法启用vector导致向量计算转为标量计算"
msgstr "Example: The compare of i64/i32 cannot enable vector on NPU, causing vector computation to be converted to scalar computation."

msgid "【描述】i64/i32 的cmp在npu上无法启用vector，退化为scalar计算效率降低；通过转化为fp32来利用vec_cast和vec_cmp实现vector操作加速。 【注意】在tl.load和tl.save中的mask使用cmp功能，大部分情况下编译器可以自动优化为vec操作，本例中tl.where则需要手动转换。"
msgstr "[Description] The cmp of i64/i32 cannot enable vector on NPU, degrading to scalar computation with reduced efficiency; by converting to fp32, vec_cast and vec_cmp can be used to implement vector operations for acceleration. [Note] When using cmp functionality in mask within tl.load and tl.save, the compiler can automatically optimize to vector operations in most cases; in this example, tl.where requires manual conversion."

msgid "**示例图** 优化前后数据对比图 ![图2 optimization2](../figures/optimization.png) 通过分析图中的数据可以发现，优化前后的aiv_scalar_time(us)和aiv_scalar_ratio差距较大，说明性能差的原因是有很多scalar运算， 通过采集[算子仿真流水图](#算子仿真流水图)可以得到visualize_data.bin，再用MindStudio Insight解析visualize_data.bin，可以发现xbar = tl.where(cols < N, x - mean, 0.0)有很多scalar运算，通过上面优化可以减少scalar运算。"
msgstr "**Example Figure** Comparison of data before and after optimization ![Figure 2 optimization2](../figures/optimization.png) By analyzing the data in the figure, it can be found that the aiv_scalar_time(us) and aiv_scalar_ratio differ significantly before and after optimization, indicating that the poor performance is due to a large number of scalar operations. By collecting the [operator simulation pipeline diagram](#算子仿真流水图), the visualize_data.bin can be obtained. Then, using MindStudio Insight to parse visualize_data.bin, it can be observed that `xbar = tl.where(cols < N, x - mean, 0.0)` involves many scalar operations, which can be reduced through the optimization described above."

msgid "图2 optimization2"
msgstr "Figure 2 optimization2"

msgid "UB Overflow 问题排查指南"
msgstr "UB Overflow Troubleshooting Guide"

msgid "概述"
msgstr "Overview"

msgid "UB Overflow 是 Triton-Ascend 开发中常见的问题。本文档详细介绍 UB Overflow 的常见原因、解决方案和调试方法。"
msgstr "UB Overflow is a common issue in Triton-Ascend development. This document provides a detailed overview of the common causes, solutions, and debugging methods for UB Overflow."

msgid "常见原因及解决方案"
msgstr "Common Causes and Solutions"

msgid "1. 使用了会增加 UB 开销的接口参数"
msgstr "Used interface parameters that increase UB overhead"

msgid "某些接口在特定参数配置下会自动添加额外的处理逻辑，导致 UB 空间使用增加："
msgstr "Certain interfaces automatically add additional processing logic under specific parameter configurations, leading to increased UB space usage."

msgid "`tl.maximum`、`tl.minimum`、`tl.clamp` 接口的 `propagate_nan` 参数"
msgstr "The `propagate_nan` parameter of the `tl.maximum`, `tl.minimum`, and `tl.clamp` interfaces"

msgid "**问题描述：** 当设置 `propagate_nan=tl.PropagateNAN.NONE` 时，系统会自动添加 NaN 值检测和处理逻辑。"
msgstr "**Problem Description:** When setting `propagate_nan=tl.PropagateNAN.NONE`, the system automatically adds NaN value detection and handling logic."

msgid "**影响：**"
msgstr "**Impact:**"

msgid "显著增加 UB 空间使用"
msgstr "Significantly increase UB space usage"

msgid "可能导致性能下降"
msgstr "May cause performance degradation."

msgid "**解决方案：**"
msgstr "**Solution:**"

msgid "如果输入数据不包含 NaN 值或不需要严格的 NaN 处理语义，考虑调整 `propagate_nan` 参数值"
msgstr "If the input data does not contain NaN values or strict NaN handling semantics are not required, consider adjusting the `propagate_nan` parameter value."

msgid "在 UB 空间紧张的场景下，优先选择不会触发额外 NaN 处理的参数配置"
msgstr "In scenarios where UB space is limited, prioritize parameter configurations that do not trigger additional NaN handling."

msgid "2. 中间变量过多"
msgstr "2. Too many intermediate variables"

msgid "**问题：** kernel 中定义了大量临时张量或中间计算结果"
msgstr "**Problem:** A large number of temporary tensors or intermediate computation results are defined in the kernel."

msgid "减少不必要的中间变量"
msgstr "Reduce unnecessary intermediate variables"

msgid "复用已分配的缓冲区"
msgstr "Reuse the allocated buffer"

msgid "将大计算拆分为多个小 kernel"
msgstr "Split large computations into multiple small kernels"

msgid "3. shape 过大"
msgstr "3. shape is too large"

msgid "**问题：** 处理高维/大 shape 张量"
msgstr "**Problem:** Handling high-dimensional/large shape tensors"

msgid "考虑将大 tensor 分块处理"
msgstr "Consider processing large tensors in blocks."

msgid "修改分块策略，减小每块的大小"
msgstr "Modify the chunking strategy to reduce the size of each chunk."

msgid "调试建议"
msgstr "Debugging Suggestions"

msgid "**开启详细日志**"
msgstr "**Enable Detailed Logging**"

msgid "使用 `TRITON_DEBUG=1` 查看详细的编译信息"
msgstr "Use `TRITON_DEBUG=1` to view detailed compilation information."

msgid "定位具体哪个算子导致 UB 溢出"
msgstr "Locate which specific operator causes the UB overflow"

msgid "**逐步排查**"
msgstr "**Step-by-step troubleshooting**"

msgid "通过注释掉部分代码，定位导致问题的具体操作"
msgstr "By commenting out parts of the code, locate the specific operation causing the issue."

msgid "**参考文档**"
msgstr "**Reference Documentation**"

msgid "查看各接口文档中的\"特殊限制说明\"部分"
msgstr "Refer to the \"Special Restrictions\" section in each API documentation."

msgid "了解可能增加 UB 开销的参数配置"
msgstr "Understanding parameter configurations that may increase UB overhead"

msgid "**优化策略**"
msgstr "**Optimization Strategy**"

msgid "优先处理占用 UB 空间较大的算子"
msgstr "Prioritize handling operators that occupy a large amount of UB space."

msgid "考虑重新设计算法以减少中间变量"
msgstr "Consider redesigning the algorithm to reduce intermediate variables."

msgid "考虑修改分块策略"
msgstr "Consider modifying the chunking strategy."
